// game drops a release during a centring move, while the user pin chooser is open, or when the window loses
// focus. CMF notes which key turned each movement flag on, so that key's release always clears it; clears every
// held key when the game reports a focus or input device change; and logs one line per burst of zoom or
// movement naming what moved the map. Flags: 1 zoom in, 2 zoom out, 4 up, 8 down, 16 left, 32 right.
